WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600
Every morning, the same ritual.
Ten job boards.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.600
Fifty tabs.
The same posting, five times over.

3
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.360
Meet Job Radar.
Your job feed, tuned to you.

4
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:15.535
Pick your sources: job boards, company
career pages, even your alert emails.

5
00:00:15.535 --> 00:00:16.950
All in one place.

6
00:00:18.045 --> 00:00:21.490
Duplicates merge into one.
Agencies and closed jobs get marked,

7
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.485
and hidden tricks aimed
at AI are stripped out.

8
00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:29.802
Now tell it what you want, in plain words:
your salary floor, your must-haves,

9
00:00:29.802 --> 00:00:30.595
your deal-breakers.

10
00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:35.815
Add "no ad-tech", and the ad-tech job
drops from eighty-one to twenty-four.

11
00:00:36.945 --> 00:00:40.596
AI reads every posting, on the
AI plan you already pay for,

12
00:00:40.596 --> 00:00:43.825
and scores it from zero to
a hundred, with reasons.

13
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.821
It digs out the salary as one yearly
number, and breaks the job down:

14
00:00:48.821 --> 00:00:50.660
you tick four of five must-haves.

15
00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.550
The good ones land on your phone.

16
00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:57.190
Thumbs up, skip, or save, right in
Telegram, and your board keeps up.

17
00:00:58.255 --> 00:01:00.895
It all runs on your own machine.
No accounts.

18
00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:01.615
No telemetry.

19
00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:03.820
The right jobs find you.
